From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GDmio <zhalin66@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 04:49:34 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 16/31] BlueOS: Live music visualizer view for widgets

BlueOSVisualizerView is allowed in RemoteViews (@RemoteView, hidden), so
home screen widgets can use it: it draws itself every frame inside the
launcher (bars, bars around the album art, waves, bars from the middle).
The spectrum comes from SystemUI's visualizer service through read-only
shared memory; the view binds it as the launcher only while music plays
and it is visible. Without it, or when it stays silent while playing
(e.g. offloaded playback), the view plays a made-up animation instead.

Change-Id: Id69a09db7b774060b8654525966f8132ebf3c66b
